    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9799" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίβᾰσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>resistance,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				73.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				38
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.584f
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ κατ᾽ ἀντίβασιν ἁφή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					10.2
