				Sor.
				2.10
			</span></i>,cf. <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				9.23.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>ground of opposition</i>(?), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφόρου τετευχότα -σεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Sign.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in the
			ballista, <i>counter-prop,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Vitr.
				10.11.9
			</span></i>.</div>
